    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/88163bf18890f453b512cefa96f183e9.poster.avif?t=1724408422\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/88163bf18890f453b512cefa96f183e9.webm?t=1724408422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/88163bf18890f453b512cefa96f183e9.mp4?t=1724408422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Jash AKA &quot;Just a SHMUP ?&quot; is a side-scrolling 3D game and an original shoot'em up, you will have to take the controls of the Captain's ship and fight against<br>original enemies, making the best use of your famous additional weapon &quot;The Force&quot;.<br><br>The game immerses you in the heart of the action, thanks to beautiful graphics, a sound environment and many surprises await you in Space:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/5f5c265d04c6c0986da1c6a0b7f40e55.avif?t=1724408422\" /></div><br><br>And elsewhere:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/106889910cd8a965205aad104ad8d6f5.avif?t=1724408422\" /></div><br><br>You never know which situations will have to face the Captain, and for more interactivity the Captain can talk to the player:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/1d34979c6fcb7a19431159894f26fd23.poster.avif?t=1724408422\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/1d34979c6fcb7a19431159894f26fd23.webm?t=1724408422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/1d34979c6fcb7a19431159894f26fd23.mp4?t=1724408422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><u>Different gameplay and not just a shoot'em up:</u><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/a9128a97787975ca97c8c5d9b5d4b979.avif?t=1724408422\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tenacious and original Bosses:</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/e564cbcffb2c996c284062f010fbe43e.avif?t=1724408422\" /></div><br><br><strong>And a Survival Mode, with a leaderboard:</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/846db7d20cbd61f26ecc587ce2f5b746.poster.avif?t=1724408422\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/846db7d20cbd61f26ecc587ce2f5b746.webm?t=1724408422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/846db7d20cbd61f26ecc587ce2f5b746.mp4?t=1724408422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What makes Jash unique?</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different gameplay, the spirit and ambiance of the game.<br></li><li>Throughout the game, you will go from surprises to surprises.<br></li><li>During the game, you will also have the pleasure of discovering many references and winks. I won't tell you more, it will be a surprise.<br></li><li>You can unlock content by completing the game.<br></li><li>Jash is a first game of a trilogy, in his spirit it's an adventure and action. Next game will have different styles, always to surprise the player.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/88163bf18890f453b512cefa96f183e9.poster.avif?t=1724408422\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/88163bf18890f453b512cefa96f183e9.webm?t=1724408422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/88163bf18890f453b512cefa96f183e9.mp4?t=1724408422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Jash AKA &quot;Just a SHMUP ?&quot; is a side-scrolling 3D game and an original shoot'em up, you will have to take the controls of the Captain's ship and fight against<br>original enemies, making the best use of your famous additional weapon &quot;The Force&quot;.<br><br>The game immerses you in the heart of the action, thanks to beautiful graphics, a sound environment and many surprises await you in Space:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/5f5c265d04c6c0986da1c6a0b7f40e55.avif?t=1724408422\" /></div><br><br>And elsewhere:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/106889910cd8a965205aad104ad8d6f5.avif?t=1724408422\" /></div><br><br>You never know which situations will have to face the Captain, and for more interactivity the Captain can talk to the player:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/1d34979c6fcb7a19431159894f26fd23.poster.avif?t=1724408422\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/1d34979c6fcb7a19431159894f26fd23.webm?t=1724408422\" type=\"video/webm; 